                  "welcome":  "Welcome, Trailblazer! I\u0027m March 7th.\n\nTap /help to see everything I can do for you.\nJoin our channel below for the latest updates on the game and the bot.",
                  "help":  "Here are the commands you can use:\n\n/start - start the bot and see welcome message\n/help - see this message again\n/login - link your game account with the bot (UID required)\n/logout - unlink your game account from the bot\n/switch - switch between linked game accounts (if you have multiple)\n/token_login - link your account using cookies (for notes access)\n/token_logout - unlink your endfield account from the bot\n/token_help - see instructions to get your cookies\n/myuid - see your linked game account UID\n/myc - see your profile cards\n/notes - see your live in-game notes (cookies required)\n/settings - customize your preferences and language\n/admin_help - see admin commands (admins and bot owner only)\n/moc - Memory of Chaos card\n/apoc - Apocalyptic Shadow card\n/anomaly - anomaly card\n/purefiction - Pure Fiction card\n/ask - ask me anything about Honkai: Star Rail lore\n/ask_reset - start a fresh lore conversation\n/ask_status - your lore chat usage for today\n/group_settings - group admins: manage this group\u0027s features",
